            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 131861,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ensure that the loop doesn't print <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the skip logic so the loop prints <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>2</code>, and <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>3</code>, followed by <code>continue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131862,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is true regarding the <code>continue</code> block?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>continue</code> statement skips the rest of the current loop's block</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>continue</code> statement stops the loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>continue</code> statement runs after the loop finishes</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>continue</code> statement skips the rest of the current loop's block.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A loop's block prints <code>Start</code>, reaches <code>continue</code>, then has a line to print <code>End</code>.</p><p>What prints during that pass?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Only <code>Start</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Only <code>End</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Both <code>Start</code> and <code>End</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Only <code>Start</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 131863,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ensure the loop stops once <code>count</code> reaches <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make the loop print only <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, and <code>2</code>, then end the loop completely.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>==</code>, followed by <code>3</code>, and finally <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 131864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is true regarding the <code>break</code> statement inside a loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>break</code> statement stops the loop completely</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>break</code> statement skips the current iteration</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>break</code> statement runs after the loop finishes</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>break</code> statement stops the loop completely.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A <code>for</code> loop uses <code>break</code> when it finds a match before the last item. You replace it with <code>continue</code>.</p><p>What changes?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It checks the next item instead of ending the search.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It still ends the search at the match.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It restarts the search from the first item.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It checks the next item instead of ending the search.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131865,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ensure that <code>\"Loop finished!\"</code> will be printed when the loop is done.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop finished!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop finished!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the loop so it prints <code>0</code> through <code>4</code>, followed by <code>Loop finished!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop finished!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop finished!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>5</code>, followed by <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 131866,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is true regarding the <code>else</code> block?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>else</code> block of code executes once after the loop finishes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>else</code> block of code executes with every iteration of the loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>else</code> block executes only if the loop body contains no conditions</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>else</code> block of code executes once after the loop finishes.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You run a loop twice without <code>break</code>: first with zero repetitions, then with three. Its <code>else</code> prints <code>Done</code>.</p><p>How many times is <code>Done</code> printed in total?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Two times, once after each run.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">One time, only after the run with three repetitions.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Three times, once for each repetition.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Two times, once after each run.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
