            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Break out of the loop when the <code>char</code> variable holds the value <code>\"o\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" char \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" char == \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(char)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"h\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"e\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"l\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"l\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>"
